  "description": "Totstars Play Barn Nursery is a registered early years setting offering childcare and education for children aged 9 months to 5 years. The nursery operates Monday to Friday between 8:00 a.m. and 6:00 p.m. and provides a much-needed service for families in the local community.\n\nWhen we took on the lease for the property, we genuinely believed that planning permission was not required, as the building was previously used as an indoor soft play facility for children of the same age group. The previous operation provided supervised play for young children and functioned in a very similar way to how we now use the space — safely, responsibly, and for the benefit of local families.\n\nBecause the building was already purpose-built and designed for children’s activity and play, and because our use does not change the character or intensity of that use, we acted in good faith in assuming that no further planning consent was necessary.\n\nSince taking over, we have carried out only internal improvements to make the space suitable for nursery care — creating open, safe, and engaging learning areas. No external structural changes have been made",
